  "duel_note": "The unit of value is one action of a duel: me vs one foe (adjacent; for a skill with reach also 2 hexes apart), plus — with ally_present — one ally (plays Empty Posture) adjacent to both. The foe's code Y and my code (a permanent's later actions; Battle Trance's two options) are uniform over the six codes (mix); an instant is played on its action_type; Sanctuary's actions are the codes that keep it. The foe aims its Attack / Move at the ally with ally_target_rate, carries a non-permanent skill with foe_skill_rate (worth foe_skill_value to them), and when on P / EP casts a damage effect (ref_cast_elements, delta damage) with foe_cast_rate. Every (me, foe) ordered pair of the pool is enumerated exactly.",
