    "cost_note": "C (card-actions) = card + wait·(1−p_job)/p_job (an instant that finds nothing returns to hand, Rule 8 / ruling 2026-11-12: it waits in a hand slot) + extra_card (Battle Trance spends a second action card) + permanent (held in the perms strip, exposed to Rule 24) + pointbuy_retry · E[retries] (0: pointBuyPermanent re-rolls in place, difficulty only lowers the die = durability, priced in V) + locked_action · (actions_per_round − 1)/2 · (share of the codes a selfLock forbids) — Powerful Attack locks you to Attack for the rest of the round (on average one more action); an action whose choice is taken away is priced like a negated action (0.3)",
